                <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--ax-text-muted);line-height:1.5;">While the app is open: check for changes about every 30 seconds; upload changed data at most once every 5 minutes. Enabling starts a catch-up backup. Account or storage-folder changes require fresh opt-in. No automatic cloud-to-PC merge or deletion.</div>
                <div id="cloudBackupSummary" role="status" aria-live="polite" style="margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;">Checking this account's backup status...</div>
              </div>
            </div>
    
            <!-- Auth State: Log In / Sign Up Form -->
            <div id="authLoggedOutView">
              <button type="button" id="btnGoogleSignIn" style="width: 100%; margin-bottom: 10px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #dadce0; color: #1f1f1f; padding: 11px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px;">Continue with Google</button>
              <button type="button" id="btnCancelGoogleSignIn" style="display: none; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 8px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer;">Cancel Google sign-in</button>
